<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.9">
<l>aṭiyai mūṉṟai yiranta vāṟu maṅkēniṉṟāṅ kaṭalu maṇṇum viṇṇu</l>
<l>muṭiya vīraṭiyāṉ muṭittuk koṇṭa mukkiyamu</l>
<l>noṭiyu māṟavai kēṭkun tōṟumeṉ ṉeñca niṉṟaṉak kēka raintukuṅ</l>
<l>koṭiyaval viṉaiyē ṉuṉṉai yeṉṟukol kūṭuvatē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Whenever I hear of those:</l>
<l>the way [you] begged for three steps and the way you declared what is foremost which you completed</l>
<l>for yourself in two steps so that ocean, earth and sky were achieved, which are constantly there,</l>
	<l>my heart cries for you [and tears] are shed.</l>
<l>When will there be uniting with you for me with cruel harsh karma?</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
